{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1404,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7df34c612605edff06803d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好漂亮～！\r\n「人靠衣装，千代也靠衣装」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ac6fab2b26a43134b49e505959d204a3ad87494e2b96e79f0b26272e5bb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2acf93281a63b4f9b1999350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，这套衣服会让我忍不住\r\n尽情轻飘飘地跑来跑去呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc793800646305e5d519bb090fb4e8625fee86cf0ffca2768aa02e87ad2c474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a519ac2142774e0719e39de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么多衣服可以换，真开心啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2a36d986b6432ab19c25b9aac3205c066e3a39999ed9c69db696ba9e67e360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f2bb6f2de90effd0a4844f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心跳不止激动不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d835a39525ff0bc1fb5a55b152a8a2ec5a95d281aa7204396e2f710bfef1697e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eab73980b5fe9f4f6a434d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "V领的V，\r\n是Victory的Vー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c132ffdcb2e139a8aae691438428397295bfd94eb1a45a8d02ccc8abef2f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8294537d9fd6428290fc36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是常服，我也\r\n相当引人注目呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efdf7a69935245368a3f581d4a998ee10dc97ce69557a829b4fd23b9851fa44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc1e71b611a9edb017e65fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噔噔噔！这是作为特雷森赛马娘的证明哦♪\n…还挺像模像样的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dce8362a8e127a1af647fdf6820571e9247e994af4ec574eb0557dc0fea5be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aeb68b44a903f5d576e89f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然唱歌和跳舞都是刚刚接触，\n但继续学习的话一定能学会的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a06d51cf540b1bfc24105379ba29b625899c52e1b9f1522143e7e3f4a523ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58297dd2982807542cda0de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还只是脆弱的花蕾……\n但我坚信，我终有一日会开放的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae478d4aba1334aff0777a75b0b204136207587df07fb0c7e1d11383033a9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42d59886e0827f85604eacf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要保持容貌端正！正襟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77cfbbea620bcc9856d6cebcaeba01e1999231eb822dccd97a8106a34dbd4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12c5cc4bcc7b465f8ae3c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在大家面前跳舞还是有些紧张……\n不过也有因为我的舞蹈而开心的人，所以我也得加把劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f5fbad6d785ee5dd22eb1a8a76a2a4687ffe013dec69c7ada7d24fd7348e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe69702d908696f30ac2e93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把袖子这样轻舞的话——\n不觉得就有点像飘舞的樱花吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a29f9ffbee9e4ed9c0abd377f4c46e2431c7e06f215d9c67dfc2bad538c885f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29487bef554a4e81b5f67c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好漂亮～！\r\n「人靠衣装，千代也靠衣装」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ac6fab2b26a43134b49e505959d204a3ad87494e2b96e79f0b26272e5bb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d45cd0165cf048170d1c77ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，这套衣服会让我忍不住\r\n尽情轻飘飘地跑来跑去呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc793800646305e5d519bb090fb4e8625fee86cf0ffca2768aa02e87ad2c474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4c0b4c44237a18c22ccb85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么多衣服可以换，真开心啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2a36d986b6432ab19c25b9aac3205c066e3a39999ed9c69db696ba9e67e360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb77f97d1b6c875421c841f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心跳不止激动不已呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d835a39525ff0bc1fb5a55b152a8a2ec5a95d281aa7204396e2f710bfef1697e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9755770aa7cceb4ed3bc76f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac5c686ec8049a8cae37281",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预备～一起喊！胜利～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9a2cd4da88854a7241f2e63619c746374853c1ca6f7fa1fbd9ae948435b867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "8007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596d0aa847270039eb8fd572",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要切磋吗？\r\n那就来比比谁能\r\n绽放得更绚丽吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "361f919c3087a6a9c3603d8dd1f3c635315b6ec1816d76f363b3f0e010cddd09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76629581224983cfb25100e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是难缠的对手呢…！\r\n既然如此，我也要\r\n再为您绽放一朵花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa1ef3287c0f177bd8d5eb67cf7fe1a88451c6a9067b5fa927cc2fe6193e0a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60952e9a4193152103bfaf8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\n正所谓『好的问候胜过好的萝卜』！\n今天也请您多多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45eebeb939cc04213d0a7a9058e61a7088a1b1fcba321aee7b4910efc7e65bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97afb3884c6efb6e0801fb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『睡眼惺忪的早晨才蕴涵着胜机』！\n今天我起床之后，立马就去做了体操，\n现在身心舒畅哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c6d3ced601ca6f0e1f556dc0a4d82c316e892dddbb6ddd4dd0e172eecb7f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0fc3aef54fda42fd63f9935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您吃过午饭了吗？正所谓『要想过上\n好的一天就得吃上好的午饭』！\n吃饱了下午才有力气继续努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1b975c70c91c2c10e6c867640e47b7e37d1fb246de708eb297250d3f4868fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99c8ec7792b64792433dc19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『今天的红豆馅会变作明天的悔恨』。\n买来的点心实在是太好吃了，\n有些抵挡不住它的诱惑啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "90293d846d620a1309338c06aa7a4399c150b95606893b25bacf11ef70d2e241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e3a1ab538d2fa47a0a3e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经这个时间了吗……\n俗话说『不睡觉的话太阳就不会升起』！\n今天可要记得好好休息哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "234f9dac626d302889a6b74d89b5db390778f1d9176a849baf33fb8e88749742",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9704fa5c98107a9227a9f755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经快要到第二天了呀……\n我不管有多困，\n睡前都会反省一下今天的所作所为呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec10db28f2455cf731337ef468bcd79b3e3e4da98d1810100cfbc999caaad62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f104f652d0891ae3f9768b13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『凡赛马娘皆有春来之日』！\n春天和我的名字很相称呢～\n一想到这个，就觉得可以继续努力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d1a6f8a37732ae6d91a7520998ff5b8755e47a6637a9856f929a4bbc90dcc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14eafce04cfe6d77f4053d27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『补充水分能够打开身心的池塘』！\n注意好自己的身体状况，\n一起度过充实的夏天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69274ff0133e059dc11b4e76efed816e1f447500708db52f41604892d97b8653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e821f2b15db9f15facb4f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『一万个人眼中有一万种秋季』呢！\n训练员喜欢怎样的秋天呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1acafd04e014fd8d212e67a253e1e9c6ed52492516fbcd08abe2b9a89fbcc0ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfbd0a00307220f57d7da4da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『身体比大脑更早察觉到寒意』！\n嘿嘿，我的防寒对策非常完美哦！\n为了不败给寒冷，今天也加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e8e97bf0196817203b4288049b2d641a58b4ba4693f5eb33335cc254cc2982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a58d100ca063431517a7f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上起床的心情如何？\r\n跟我同寝室的阿尔丹同学似乎\r\n不太擅长立刻清醒过来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5d0f75269da158e46a6186659871bacc0dd542ac5e63f0404a1053914df6b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6c2deb89e9871992b3a18a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～～啊，早上好！\r\n感觉我的心境也随着这件衣服，\r\n变得既温暖又开朗了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b600bf7e0eaf7da0f7b9b67c65617e00076bb241939caa24e4b95dfb62f66b90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3eb532e393398635132fd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代午安！\r\n啊，没什么，我只是想试试看有没有\r\n充满我个人风格的午间问候……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee57c864cc73c17d99658b7df2620ab3eff21077b0844e05497f9ecb95130b18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0df409d1de39b9fbd6744ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我在食堂吃的红豆面包上，\r\n点缀了盐渍樱花哦！\r\n咸咸的非常美味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ccb8b5a23b6f356a97a68ab0c7f02346ee905d4434af072b91c359f23256abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7503230ca6b8342113d17fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我想成为美丽的夜樱……\r\n似乎还缺少了一点点\r\n成熟的氛围呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38c9403af40f2c3b6fd3bfe8f20decb326785fe4b1f5cfdb7807b5bd2995665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f962a73162371d6175ad4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上好。\r\n这、这可不是睡衣哦？\r\n是一件非常珍贵的衣服……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "165d0cea8cab654de95977bc7ca65bdb362edaaec042719ecc84bdc2b4d4352f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4722918438a38a071f1776e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「春之晨晓」！\r\n这句……应该不会出现在\r\n古文考试里吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "32776e22204012c106294da8cb3da85864299fd3c7743c2283134fae43203892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17705db4938fa6db4679e80d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手臂好像有点晒黑了呢。\r\n不过这恰到好处的黑还带点华丽感，\r\n感觉也挺适合我的……？\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "381c341539f1b13fd5d79460637ddca68687296b1d3edeff07b504b6e9f4d24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9abd8e1fa8623d068cab1e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想秉持着\r\n「秋天是努力『求』取的季节！」的\r\n精神来挑战每一件事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b823bb48f2090247889d2ff0e3d162dc869fc4091f6b4176124bbae2b05e4183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1274607a306ce1f8de649f65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢的冬季运动\r\n当然是滑雪啦！\r\n感觉丸善斯基前辈也会很擅长呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3d434f572c2f6c365afc5972f469cc01a418627acc50d37ac5f7ce18be4392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edda94fa8fc8007cba5363ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93615d4eb7c22973ff54e919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6408c09b1708e6bc6f83a57d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想像丸善斯基小姐那样，\n像个成熟的大人那样打招呼呢……\n……嗨♪……算、算了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c885e8edaa6445c92ad7acd7fb4bee41dd26baaa345f488cfd89b155e41298a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e135f2f1bcbb181356b1bc32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和阿尔丹同学一起选了和点心很搭的\n日本茶呢。说起来，上次选的是\n红茶……下次要不选绿茶吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "abe45c08f76d0bbbbc0573538571c28ef6bca3c96dc0c57bcd85903861394598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a641401034c5ecb31d9cb759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代王千代王千代王！…唔……\n果然和进王同学的名字比起来，\n我的名字这样连着读不大顺口呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44700ce12f869b6cc1321db2a9a276e83c91d030a059781ec5eb2c1a27039a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b626d575ee6c74c68093db0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做红豆馅的时候会不小心做太多……\n因为在家习惯了，不小心会把家人的份也一起做了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639df0937a44b223074cfa5d2009a6824bdc56034074f9806983124ae10d486f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28bbfa1f904ea27c507571f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『整洁的房间是心灵的宝石箱』！\n别看我这样，我对整理东西还是很在行的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0093514e0709c32c150948d0f5ad83775ac5f1391093b63ce73ca92600f1823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4ba687ba6b56b005922953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『舞台与赛场同处一片天空之下』！\n在舞台上也要全力以赴地表演呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14aa0cd31f3967092316cbce86bb085a4c44e31fa7ec9c9e1c8a699c4d6e6740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2dde30aad6cf5352a7b94d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次完成难度很高的舞蹈时，\n就会充分感觉到自己的成长……\n然后就有继续努力的干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf86c467ac65bad746f54a608ef95cb92d12219e95c9db4c5fc379ad10676aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47a090860af4579e88ccafbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『比赛中也要让心灵时刻满开』！\n寄宿在这身衣服之中的愿望，\n我一定会让其开花结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6375f57216e1e243cc58ecf48bb05f99461454b2f1190912141a26297908f296",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b27b4a7d93c49da508cca55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基小姐对我说过：\n『小千代，这身决胜服和你很搭哦』……\n诶嘿嘿嘿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f69f8e89a620e4f7cb97499edb00755fb06b7fe028c95f4385d48eec52a047c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdad766b0b3d78b37f18d639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨跑后深呼吸的话，\n清新的空气能让我一下子就打起精神来！\n我很喜欢这种感觉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1857693b79aa28be2327e6595468a4cf11df33361ef1a3c276e38f9194e6ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b02be311a27b88ab5b956c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须要复习刚刚学习的内容…正所谓\n『早早复习学力就会节节高升』！\n啊，当然、预习也很重要呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd6b2ef4addb4e2f1cce253d5272d3289be4cda9e455cc174be0b8b859a9ed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b441758ae920237165c41bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要切磋吗？\n那就来比比谁能\n绽放得更绚丽吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84f5fafc6a12838baf5b1181d057977b843ffb02bd3f30cf0500c67094990dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f47155f7c9d5ee99bcc52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼嗯～～……啊哇哇哇！\n我刚刚不是在打哈欠哦！是那个……\n嗯……对了！是打哈欠的练习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c031a980dd4be53c8c99037dc2cdd12b3fcec95c09a6ea4f6addda841a5262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5fc23b1ea7dc4c12885647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个季节的话就可以做樱饼了呢。\n因为我今年也打算做很多，所以可以的话……\n能请您帮帮我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdc791afbd35c2d297033f4a60e19925f9e8699c567d58325c7b6e95ec2b758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb48104e849089aab97f2a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节的水羊羹很好吃呢……\n啊！不过，也想吃锦玉呢！\n唔嗯～实在不知道吃哪个好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fdac048fd7d70a712b3fc6f9e3c8f7abaa83631a9e9c3e96d4e7eb18a4bb7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98a7c7a0a2c822e630ee958",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿尔丹同学送了我栗子蛋糕，\n所以我做了栗子蒸羊羹作为回礼哦！\n不知道合不合她口味呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "63daf86d2bdc249d5ebe54cf5fea9464c531f111bc2dbd48d614cf84820e897c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5a30a7e723c642eccccb92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在常去的点心店里看见了柚子饼哦！\n不知不觉已经到这个季节了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0dfc99e094e813ead3993837401b43ca9674eecbc6a636df46f82a530735e03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571aaba1bed08be1ee8ec82b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进王同学、樱花桂冠同学，\r\n再加上我！\r\n我们是「胜利俱乐部」，哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f455085e40d1342ba4014b12656effc94fd678a6d03988ed2a28d4d9aaecd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8742944a8e478547123907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一看到高雅的阿尔丹同学……\r\n我也会忍不住挺直腰板呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb241a1d016142dd197d347d21115450a4295f3f3a5e5dda9eebf539bac6cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ccd0846af6d8382920d1525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要穿这件衣服去吃烤肉，\r\n感觉我会非常紧张……\r\n深怕一不小心被酱汁溅到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "619b4ccf901ed03f7fac93ed36b57b52acac7f299c1c8d53ebbf3f05d8cbf7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a55ad2c50b1a43931d747e53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道为什么，唯独和超级溪流前辈的时间\r\n总是合不上呢～\r\n明明我很想多和她相处的说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55c25ba1dbfb11a2b3198334cc6084d176d6ae47bf944c9046961d44efc098",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5691863f211c10edb851280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花是樱花，目白是目白。\r\n「有多少情谊，情意就有多深」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b2d6a7765a8f6b661aef712e82a696ebe95c1c8eb8d4e1194dc934d092fd126",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a7168a1b84ae378171718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓的晨礼服，\r\n是早上穿的意思吗……？\r\n那就代表礼服也可以在早上穿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a163b2e2e13c6da882786476e03aa7290dfd9847abb32391479474a758b2dc03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ccf9ad0ebdba2282a93104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午试着和草上飞同学比比和歌吧。\r\n虽然我常常被大家说有种\r\n难以理解的深奥感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe124e1740a1a8fb2852ae8d2f22b9d1ff3c4e62d585cce588485783a8325ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b8dd385ef53edd083369f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「只要等待，夜路也会变明亮」～！\r\n我会带着这样的心情大步迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2626d182dd749cef7254db88b4f7f070bd8a8850c0ed7dda7cc8a120a8ce71d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8635980b59181f3b21f04d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直道舞会的季节……\r\n大家怀揣着各自的心情，\r\n走在樱花树道下……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d32593612f9bb4404d83a6839e5212543a84e00760501d6dbe7302c3278aac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a8ec6b24fd88476407235b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色的连衣裙\r\n很适合夏天呢。就像\r\n「白鱼入白浪」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fd1862c53285159a0620e7264a16c5cc2b87dcd2880c29367b4be2706894a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b06a0a83f2e667ed140f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您知道吗？\r\n即使到了秋天，\r\n也依然会有樱花绽放哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2049ebbcd0a3be82f61323f903d2ac20a7755f476bbecbbc383091f1943d66a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7b1c1e3c6c41ca35b25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哇哇，说我像雪之妖精\r\n实在是太夸奖我了啦～\r\n才没有我这么冒失的妖精呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e890091017d54eea0606609434ed65ab3834648b98ea4429308c5af2182c4495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22a536dca6709366b978dc7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这副耳环跟\r\n阿尔丹同学是成对的哦♪\r\n也得想办法给八重无敌同学送一副……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5e91bb7fad8813256f63ded2064aae1586396846e5905fa304ca57a33deb4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f09a090f81869eb192df74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两条叠戴在一起的项链，\r\n就像泥地赛道与\r\n草地赛道的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd70d456fac9cb7ae27187ae888f94a15f07df703e5478a7b1654b9ce563d49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554e8982453d70034c4bd7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的准备已经做好了，\n今天也要不断努力、不断积累！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2181c9a2f68d45aa5cfba79758331819cb1fea57349000921156563f7089cee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b5268a5b365fa60f6b0fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862ea5eaad5eb518ae1db46f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不发芽的话就吃不了樱饼』！\n得一步步地踏实前进才行呢。\n今天也拜托您了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebab57075774fcb8f5889f62b0be7fd2569684929360c97a9efbfeea12f6334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13f73ffbea27236db448639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体感觉好轻盈……！\n请告诉我训练内容吧，不用多虑啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "975a61aa56af078686ff094a802d64a153f475be3c48cde2a0ebd17bdb28520c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da7e94afb3cf99b3f4795fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天准备先做什么训练呢？\n不管是什么训练我都会好好完成的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec53e415195573217549e758a9c36cc7657904260cf7a32bf41632443cb3429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a392be1555a3bdeb40c52b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然训练员都这么努力了，\n我也得加把劲才行！\n那遥远的梦想，就让我们一起实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d430183e7c9cf8b022607c175e54f3ab42cb5510ea998ed67dd0e9be18b69cfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50ef30088821f06666bc3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿！训练员的指导，\n我已经全～部好好记在千代笔记上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6a2db719478d6d1c6b57bb0661aed1028bad025ea292fa65cf0f95859dfcde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
